Data provenance note

All scenarios in this release are synthetic. They contain no real customer
data, no real personal data, and no recordings of real people. Personas,
account identifiers, and contact details are fabricated; e-mail addresses use
the reserved `example.test` domain. Audio assets are synthesized via TTS.
Per-scenario source, license, consent, and contamination metadata is recorded
in `data/openvoicecs/provenance_v0.1.json`.

Real customer data is out of scope for this benchmark unless it is newly
collected, consented, licensed, anonymized, and contamination-reviewed. See
`GOVERNANCE.md`.
